WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.055
On Flowers-102 under hue shifts, accuracy nearly triples,

00:00:06.135 --> 00:00:08.646
from thirteen to thirty-three percent.

00:00:08.726 --> 00:00:15.804
On the long-tailed color experiment the equivariant
network gains almost twenty points over the baseline.

00:00:15.884 --> 00:00:22.826
CIFAR-100 improves by fifteen points and Stanford
Cars by roughly thirteen points on hue-shifted tests.

00:00:22.906 --> 00:00:26.302
And all of this comes at a modest compute overhead,

00:00:26.382 --> 00:00:32.369
since the filter decomposition keeps the increase
in operations and parameters to a small

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:34.960
factor of the number of hue rotations.
